DT-MARL environment (trace-driven replay of the CloudSim Digital Twin)
  agents            : 10 (one per edge node)
  topology          : ring topology, n=10, offsets=[-2, -1, 1, 2], degree=4, plus 1 cloud tier (id -2)
  obs dim / agent   : 48
  centralized state : 489
  actions           : 4 (STAY, MIGRATE_TO_NEIGHBOR_EDGE, MIGRATE_TO_CLOUD, PREEMPTIVE_REROUTE)
